   "solution": "Read the first vertical patrol from the left bank and cross to the raised central refuge while the slab supports you. Read the second lane from that refuge, reach the far tally and wait on permanent stone for glass. Re-enter the glass beside the second patrol and drop onto the lower island. At its protected right end, read the horizontal patrol, jump above its return line, then dash left and descend into the low exit tunnel.",
