   "solution": "Send the broad stone through the low portal before following it. It stops beneath the receiver well and becomes a shield against both upward beams. Enter the well through its upper window, land on the pale floor, and leave that floor to spend it while the cargo protects you. Dash down onto the stone to lower it below the east wall. Climb back out, descend outside that wall, and drive the newly exposed stone left: the beams now reach the sealed receivers while you remain on their safe side. Return up the outside wall to the open high gallery.",
