   "novelty": "The two blockers must be removed in opposite ways and in a specific order. Removing the pale floor reveals the cargo floor; lowering cargo changes which face can be pushed; the final return changes it from indispensable protection into the obstruction to remove. The portal carries one object and its solver through the same mouth rather than supplying a repeated fling course.",
